# pciutils, toolchain llvm
### lib/ names the current version of pci_fill_info with a .symver in inline assembly, whose target
### name the sources never use themselves: LLVM sees no reference to it, drops the definition, and lld
### stops ("default version symbol pci_fill_info@@LIBPCI_3.15 must be defined"). gcc keeps it, and with
### clang the library is built without LTO, as lfs/fuse is
PKG_OVERRIDELTO=0
